{"synced":[{"time":3.64,"text":"Wise men once said"},{"time":6.49,"text":"\"Wild winds are death to the candle\""},{"time":9.17,"text":"A rose by any other name is a scandal"},{"time":14.89,"text":"Cautions issued, he stood"},{"time":18.89,"text":"Shooting the messengers"},{"time":20.41,"text":"They tried to warn him about her"},{"time":26.23,"text":"Cross your thoughtless heart"},{"time":29.08,"text":"Only liquor anoints you"},{"time":31.77,"text":"She's the albatross"},{"time":34.76,"text":"She is here to destroy you"},{"time":38.52,"text":"Wise men once said"},{"time":41.25,"text":"\"One bad seed kills the garden\""},{"time":44.22,"text":"\"One less temptress."},{"time":46.88,"text":"One less dagger to sharpen\""},{"time":49.62,"text":"Locked me up in towers"},{"time":53.36,"text":"But I'd visit in your dreams"},{"time":55.48,"text":"And they tried to warn you about me"},{"time":61.13,"text":"Cross your thoughtless heart"},{"time":63.99,"text":"Only liquor anoints you"},{"time":66.66,"text":"She's the albatross"},{"time":69.47,"text":"She is here to destroy you"},{"time":72.22,"text":"Devils that you know"},{"time":75.08,"text":"Raise worse hell than a stranger"},{"time":77.77,"text":"She's the death you chose"},{"time":80.7,"text":"You're in terrible danger"},{"time":86.42,"text":"And when that sky rains fire on you"},{"time":91.81,"text":"And you're persona non grata"},{"time":97.32,"text":"I'll tell you how I've been there too"},{"time":103.39,"text":"And that none of it matters"},{"time":108.37,"text":"Wise men once read fake news"},{"time":112.43,"text":"And they believed it"},{"time":113.84,"text":"Jackals raised their hackles"},{"time":117.75,"text":"You couldn't conceive it"},{"time":119.4,"text":"You were sleeping soundly"},{"time":122.82,"text":"When they dragged you from your bed"},{"time":125.25,"text":"And I tried to warn you about them"},{"time":130.01,"text":"So I crossed my thoughtless heart"},{"time":133.65,"text":"Spread my wings like a parachute"},{"time":136.43,"text":"I'm the albatross"},{"time":139.27,"text":"I swept in at the rescue"},{"time":141.92,"text":"The devil that you know"},{"time":144.73,"text":"Looks now more like an angel"},{"time":147.62,"text":"I'm the life you chose"},{"time":150.23,"text":"And all this terrible danger"},{"time":154.47,"text":""},{"time":157.8,"text":""},{"time":164.12,"text":"So cross your thoughtless heart"},{"time":169.94,"text":"She's the albatross"},{"time":172.79,"text":"She is here to destroy you"},{"time":175.52,"text":""}],"plain":null}